### su2qc.circuits.synth_l12.synth_unitary

**Signature** `synth_unitary(group, theta, g2, m)`
**Source** `runs/section8_v0.5.0_20260907T0628Z/src/su2qc/circuits/synth_l12.py:249-259` (`@lru_cache(maxsize=64)`, line 248)
